hell, don't you get?

255
00:17:08,600 --> 00:17:11,880
We are not going down there Aw, why?

256
00:17:12,380 --> 00:17:13,617
It's pretty obvious.

257
00:17:13,700 --> 00:17:15,797
We wanna go up, not down.

258
00:17:15,880 --> 00:17:17,080
Up, up.

259
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:19,417
Yeah, we're trying to escape!

260
00:17:19,500 --> 00:17:21,197
And that's up, don't you get it?

261
00:17:21,280 --> 00:17:25,520
Man, that is one really big
bloody booger I just picked.

262
00:17:26,600 --> 00:17:28,240
You're not even listening.

263
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:33,357
Just let him run away, straw boy.

264
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:36,297
They clearly don't have the
balls to go one step further.

265
00:17:36,380 --> 00:17:39,717
Hey, even my nose is a damn
ball. Your what? Really?

266
00:17:39,800 --> 00:17:40,677
That is weird.

267
00:17:40,760 --> 00:17:42,878
Okay, we are getting off topic here.

268
00:17:43,280 --> 00:17:47,104
How about you stop pulling my tail
and I'll get back to spinning?

269
00:17:47,520 --> 00:17:49,638
We've got some brilliant minds here!

270
00:17:55,700 --> 00:17:59,465
Hey, is it just me, or does it
look like the ceiling's going up?

271
00:18:00,060 --> 00:18:02,120
Ah, yeah, you're right, it is.

272
00:18:02,780 --> 00:18:04,417
There's kind of a loud rumbling,

273
00:18:04,500 --> 00:18:08,382
too, and you know this rushing
sensation, it sort of feels like...

274
00:18:08,660 --> 00:18:11,020
The ceiling's not rising, we're falling!

275
00:18:14,020 --> 00:18:14,850
Oh, no!

276
00:18:15,380 --> 00:18:18,917
Oh, my muggy ball must have been so
powerful it caused the floor to collapse.

277
00:18:19,000 --> 00:18:19,830
You wish!

278
00:18:19,913 --> 00:18:22,157
It was the force of my
heavy kick that did it!

279
00:18:22,240 --> 00:18:23,380
You're both wrong.

280
00:18:23,640 --> 00:18:26,677
It's cause my punch was so
strong it sent out shockwave!

281
00:18:26,760 --> 00:18:27,780
No, no, no.

282
00:18:27,900 --> 00:18:29,280
My wax wax power.

283
00:18:29,680 --> 00:18:32,797
Wait, I guess it didn't
really do that much, actually.

284
00:18:32,880 --> 00:18:34,040
Then shut up!

285
00:18:36,280 --> 00:18:38,540
We're pulling into no fire!

286
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:40,480
Help us!

287
00:19:02,840 --> 00:19:04,977
Please don't do this, sir.

288
00:19:05,060 --> 00:19:06,837
Please don't kill us.

289
00:19:06,920 --> 00:19:09,417
You deserve whatever happens to you.

290
00:19:09,500 --> 00:19:11,277
That's the way justice works.

291
00:19:11,360 --> 00:19:13,697
How many people have begged
you not to kill them?

292
00:19:13,780 --> 00:19:15,357
It's over.

293
00:19:15,440 --> 00:19:18,257
But we deeply regret what we've done.

294
00:19:18,340 --> 00:19:20,317
Yeah, we're sorry. Honestly?

295
00:19:20,400 --> 00:19:21,940
No, please, no!

296
00:19:32,440 --> 00:19:33,400
It burns!

297
00:19:34,600 --> 00:19:35,430
It burns!

298
00:19:37,380 --> 00:19:38,440
Keep moving!

299
00:19:39,420 --> 00:19:40,620
Lock that firewood!

300
00:19:41,960 --> 00:19:44,240
It's too hot, my body.

301
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:46,360
Even my guts are burning.

302
00:19:47,120 --> 00:19:49,317
I'd rather die than put up with this.

303
00:19:49,400 --> 00:19:51,560
I'm running for it!

304
00:19:52,740 --> 00:19:54,620
Get out of my damn way!

305
00:19:54,840 --> 00:19:56,134
I'm through with this!

306
00:19:57,360 --> 00:19:59,380
We've got a prisoner escaping!

307
00:19:59,880 --> 00:20:00,800
Move it!

308
00:20:02,140 --> 00:20:04,780
Or you want to get
thrown into the hellfire?

309
00:20:11,500 --> 00:20:12,780
I'm falling!

310
00:20:16,440 --> 00:20:17,597
What the hell?

311
00:20:17,680 --> 00:20:22,621
You can't just kill other prisoners like
that you want us to execute you right here?

312
00:20:30,240 --> 00:20:34,697
What the hell's going on the entire
upper brass showed up here Magellan

313
00:20:34,780 --> 00:20:39,427
Hannibal and the demon guards I got a
bad feeling something's about to go down!

314
00:20:40,720 --> 00:20:41,880
This is murder.

315
00:20:42,680 --> 00:20:44,277
Fashion your fireproof coat.

316
00:20:44,360 --> 00:20:47,237
Straw Hat Luffy and the others
should be coming out this door.

317
00:20:47,320 --> 00:20:49,097
No update so far.

318
00:20:49,180 --> 00:20:50,397
That's good.

319
00:20:50,480 --> 00:20:52,657
Maybe they already got
beaten by Minotaurus.

320
00:20:52,740 --> 00:20:55,677
A true warden should face
adversity instead of hiding.

321
00:20:55,760 --> 00:20:57,520
Get your ugly mug out here!

322
00:20:59,340 --> 00:21:01,100
Could you ward me first?

323
00:21:01,360 --> 00:21:02,697
It's too bright.

324
00:21:02,780 --> 00:21:05,397
When you inevitably
pass this seat on to me,

325
00:21:05,480 --> 00:21:07,857
I'd appreciate it if you
made it more open first.

326
00:21:07,940 --> 00:21:08,770
Shut up.

327
00:21:08,853 --> 00:21:13,417
This seat was custom-made to my liking,
and I like it closed, private, and dark.

328
00:21:13,500 --> 00:21:16,100
It's a metaphor for how I feel about you.

329
00:21:18,020 --> 00:21:18,850
Aw,

330
00:21:18,933 --> 00:21:19,797
if I'd have known we were just going to be

331
00:21:19,880 --> 00:21:22,537
standing around and
waiting for them this long,

332
00:21:22,620 --> 00:21:24,444
then I would have gone hunting.

333
00:21:25,120 --> 00:21:27,061
Patience, Mistress Sadie, please.

334
00:21:27,320 --> 00:21:28,757
Oh, it doesn't bother me.

335
00:21:28,840 --> 00:21:32,740
But my boys here, they
don't know what patience is.

336
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:36,100
The only thing they know is bloodlust.

337
00:21:37,940 --> 00:21:39,300
Come on now, come on.

338
00:22:05,260 --> 00:22:06,820
I have an update!

339
00:22:08,900 --> 00:22:13,177
Straw Hat Luffy and the others are now
located inside the Well Tower on Level 3,

340
00:22:13,260 --> 00:22:16,495
which means we're unfortunately
unable to monitor them.

341
00:22:17,940 --> 00:22:20,477
It'd make our lives a
hell of a lot easier if

342
00:22:20,560 --> 00:22:23,442
they simply plummeted to
their deaths from there.

343
00:22:23,900 --> 00:22:26,724
The boiling pool of blood
is right beneath them.

344
00:22:27,080 --> 00:22:29,492
They all have devilful powers, after all.

345
00:22:29,960 --> 00:22:32,136
They'd conveniently sink like stones.

346
00:22:41,640 --> 00:22:43,680
Warden Magellan, another update!

347
00:22:47,160 --> 00:22:50,817
I'm afraid that Straw Hat Luffy
has already reached this level!

348
00:22:50,900 --> 00:22:52,420
He didn't pass us.

349
00:22:52,760 --> 00:22:54,140
How is that possible?

350
00:22:55,160 --> 00:22:57,866
He apparently fell down
here through the well.

351
00:23:00,060 --> 00:23:02,942
But the well leads directly
to the pool of blood.

352
00:23:03,040 --> 00:23:04,357
How the hell are they alive?

353
00:23:04,440 --> 00:23:05,900
From what I gathered,

354
00:23:06,120 --> 00:23:08,097
they used a massive piece of the falling

355
00:23:08,180 --> 00:23:10,886
floor to shield themselves
and lead to safety.

356
00:23:11,300 --> 00:23:14,620
The bastards have luck on
their side. One more thing.

357
00:23:14,940 --> 00:23:15,800
What now?

358
00:23:16,060 --> 00:23:17,119
It stinks, Warden.

359
00:23:17,720 --> 00:23:19,380
I mean this situation.

360
00:23:19,920 --> 00:23:20,750
It stinks.

361
00:23:21,720 --> 00:23:22,580
Well, sir,

362
00:23:23,020 --> 00:23:26,717
the demon guard Minotaurus also fell into
the well, and apparently he's not moving.

363
00:23:26,800 --> 00:23:27,630
Impossible.

364
00:23:27,800 --> 00:23:28,859
They defeated him.

365
00:23:31,740 --> 00:23:33,000
It appears so.

366
00:23:33,160 --> 00:23:34,280
The poor baby.

367
00:23:34,440 --> 00:23:36,220
I won't believe it!

368
00:23:37,300 --> 00:23:38,300
Pull it together!

369
00:23:39,840 --> 00:23:41,958
You will follow my orders carefully.

370
00:23:42,340 --> 00:23:46,097
There are only two ways to get out
of level 4 that don't include dying.

371
00:23:46,180 --> 00:23:47,857
We have two staircases they can take that

372
00:23:47,940 --> 00:23:50,646
aren't currently protected
by security guards.

373
00:23:51,120 --> 00:23:54,826
From this point forward, we're
splitting our forces into three.

374
00:23:54,940 --> 00:23:57,940
Hannibal, I want you in
charge of this stairwell.

375
00:23:58,080 --> 00:23:59,727
Block all access to level 3.

376
00:24:00,220 --> 00:24:01,050
Mistress Sadie,

377
00:24:01,133 --> 00:24:05,277
I want you and the Demon Guards to defend
the stairwell leading to level five.

378
00:24:05,360 --> 00:24:06,190
No way!

379
00:24:06,273 --> 00:24:07,820
That sounds so boring.

380
00:24:08,160 --> 00:24:10,042
I want to punish those bad boys.

381
00:24:10,340 --> 00:24:13,164
Surely my outfit makes
that clear enough to you.

382
00:24:13,380 --> 00:24:17,157
Maybe I'll just let them slip past me
and have the Warden take the blame.

383
00:24:17,240 --> 00:24:18,180
Any objections?

384
00:24:20,400 --> 00:24:23,960
Please, Warden, don't do that.

385
00:24:24,240 --> 00:24:27,400
But I didn't complain this
time. You don't need to.

386
00:24:27,520 --> 00:24:29,638
I can sense you plotting against me.

387
00:24:30,560 --> 00:24:34,736
Oh, and once they're captured, you're
free to do as you wish with them.

388
00:24:35,500 --> 00:24:36,900
Oh, yes, sir.

389
00:24:37,180 --> 00:24:38,960
I can get behind that idea.

390
00:24:39,160 --> 00:24:42,977
And as for the rest of the guards, I
want you to pursue them at all costs.

391
00:24:43,060 --> 00:24:45,880
You bring them to me dead or alive. Sir!

392
00:24:47,800 --> 00:24:49,120
Almost dead works too.

393
00:24:49,320 --> 00:24:50,437
This ends right now.

394
00:24:50,520 --> 00:24:52,297
They have toyed with me long enough.

395
00:24:52,380 --> 00:24:54,280
We have a reputation to uphold.

396
00:24:54,540 --> 00:24:57,305
The burning heat hell
shall be their last stop.

397
00:25:13,020 --> 00:25:15,417
The floor is insanely hot in here.

398
00:25:15,500 --> 00:25:18,317
It's so hot my lungs feel
like they're full of fire.

399
00:25:18,400 --> 00:25:21,037
Now should we move the faster
we get out of this place?

400
00:25:21,120 --> 00:25:22,708
Now which way should we go?

401
00:25:23,880 --> 00:25:25,437
You guys sound like babies.

402
00:25:25,520 --> 00:25:26,657
Why me babies?

403
00:25:26,740 --> 00:25:28,057
It's mind over matter.

404
00:25:28,140 --> 00:25:29,477
Just pretend the fire's your friend.

405
00:25:29,560 --> 00:25:32,089
Honestly, I can't really
blame you, though.

406
00:25:32,420 --> 00:25:35,877
I do admit it's a little steamy in
here, even compared to that desert.

407
00:25:35,960 --> 00:25:39,200
Actually, maybe more than just a little...

408
00:25:40,100 --> 00:25:42,629
My friend, the fire
might be turning on me.

409
00:25:44,160 --> 00:25:45,260
Oh, crap!

410
00:25:46,060 --> 00:25:48,648
Your blathering is worse
than the damn heat!

411
00:25:51,700 --> 00:25:52,920
I know which way!

412
00:25:53,200 --> 00:25:54,240
Follow me!

413
00:25:55,300 --> 00:25:56,780
Where are you going?

414
00:25:57,420 --> 00:25:58,457
So hot!

415
00:25:58,540 --> 00:26:03,117
We're aware of that huh?

416
00:26:03,200 --> 00:26:06,200
Now where could our little
straw boy be leading us?

417
00:26:12,020 --> 00:26:13,717
Of course to the kitchen.

418
00:26:13,800 --> 00:26:17,197
Good because I'm famished.

419
00:26:17,280 --> 00:26:19,440
Wait for me, old chum!

420
00:26:20,140 --> 00:26:22,637
I'm not gonna lie food does sound good.

421
00:26:22,720 --> 00:26:24,097
Kind of hoping for some booze.

422
00:26:24,180 --> 00:26:25,010
No.

423
00:26:25,093 --> 00:26:25,960
Wait a Spitted buggy!

424
00:26:30,700 --> 00:26:32,300
That food smells so good!

425
00:26:32,460 --> 00:26:33,457
Hot, hot, hot, hot!

426
00:26:33,540 --> 00:26:35,437
Oh, boy, I can't wait for Yanni food.

427
00:26:35,520 --> 00:26:36,350
There he is!

428
00:26:36,433 --> 00:26:37,340
It's a Straw Hat oofy!

429
00:26:40,080 --> 00:26:41,845
Tang, there's a bunch of them!

430
00:26:42,900 --> 00:26:44,940
Oh, this heat's beating me down!

431
00:26:45,580 --> 00:26:48,617
But I'll get my energy back
once I get some food in me!

432
00:26:48,700 --> 00:26:49,700
Stop right there!

433
00:26:55,340 --> 00:26:56,380
Gum-Gum!

434
00:27:02,240 --> 00:27:03,070
Fireworks!

435
00:27:09,560 --> 00:27:11,877
What are you freaking out about, partner?

436
00:27:11,960 --> 00:27:13,784
Open your eyes and take a look!

437
00:27:14,300 --> 00:27:16,535
There's an ocean of guards down there.

438
00:27:16,680 --> 00:27:17,510
And think,

439
00:27:17,593 --> 00:27:19,797
this level is devoted to
the agony of the prisoners,

440
00:27:19,880 --> 00:27:23,409
yet there's not a single guard
manning the fire torture pit.

441
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:33,037
Let's go get a move on the first thing we

442
00:27:33,120 --> 00:27:35,697
should do is to check
the staircases i've got

443
00:27:35,780 --> 00:27:38,157
a feeling They ambushed us with all these

444
00:27:38,240 --> 00:27:40,946
guards they probably
boxed us in on this level

445
00:27:41,340 --> 00:27:43,637
What if they've been waiting
on level four this whole

446
00:27:43,720 --> 00:27:46,577
time that means they just
want Straw Hat We weren't even

447
00:27:46,660 --> 00:27:50,397
trying to come down here
maybe not but we are still

448
00:27:50,480 --> 00:27:53,517
trying to break out and they
do know our names and faces.

449
00:27:53,600 --> 00:27:56,247
Still, there's something
even more troubling.

450
00:27:56,440 --> 00:27:59,087
If they're sending this
many guards after us,

451
00:27:59,180 --> 00:28:02,157
it's extremely likely they're
also sending in the Impel?

452
00:28:02,240 --> 00:28:04,769
down All-Stars to put
an end to this chaos.

453
00:28:05,820 --> 00:28:09,820
And I'm not just talking about the
other three demon guards, either.

454
00:28:10,700 --> 00:28:16,160
Warden Magellan himself might make an
appearance, and then we're dead, my friend.

455
00:28:16,960 --> 00:28:18,700
Quit blocking the phone!

456
00:28:24,280 --> 00:28:25,110
Whoa!

457
00:28:25,193 --> 00:28:26,023
Freak me out!

458
00:28:26,106 --> 00:28:28,497
I thought it was a spear
or something heading at me.

459
00:28:28,580 --> 00:28:29,500
What is that?

460
00:28:31,880 --> 00:28:33,600
Aw, jeez! Gross!

461
00:28:34,100 --> 00:28:34,980
Oh, no, no!

462
00:28:43,820 --> 00:28:47,760
It's time to put an end to your
buffoonery once and for all, boy.

463
00:28:48,200 --> 00:28:49,100
Who are you?

464
00:28:51,840 --> 00:28:53,540
It's Magellan!

465
00:28:55,360 --> 00:28:59,460
I've got you now, you criminal scum!
